  "title": "Dnevna rutina",
  "titleEn": "Daily Routine",
  "grammarTip": "Reflexive verbs pair a verb with the short pronoun 'se', which stays the same for every person: 'buditi se' (to wake oneself up) → ja se budim, ti se budiš, on/ona se budi, mi se budimo, vi se budite, oni se bude. 'Se' usually comes right after the verb, but jumps in front of it in questions: 'Kada se budiš?' (When do you wake up?). Everyday routine verbs like raditi, učiti and večerati follow the regular present-tense pattern: radim, radiš, radi, radimo, radite, rade.",
